sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser as Browser client and offline workspace
    participant Gateway as API gateway and request validation
    participant Auth as Identity and permissions service
    participant Docs as Document history coordinator
    participant Cache as Distributed snapshot cache
    participant Store as Durable revision store
    participant Media as Attachment and preview service
    participant Events as Realtime event delivery

    Note over Browser,Events: Reconnect a workspace after an offline editing session and recover its revision history
    Browser->>Gateway: GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/documents/{documentId}/history?include=attachments
    activate Gateway
    Gateway->>Auth: Validate session and resolve document permissions
    activate Auth
    Auth-->>Gateway: Authorized principal with read and preview grants
    deactivate Auth
    Gateway->>Docs: Load history using cursor and requested attachment previews
    activate Docs
    Docs->>Cache: Look up latest revision snapshot for this document
    activate Cache
    alt Snapshot found and cursor still valid
        Cache-->>Docs: Cached snapshot with revision and continuation cursor
    else Snapshot missing or cursor expired
        Cache-->>Docs: No usable snapshot
        Docs->>Store: Read durable snapshot and earliest available revision
        activate Store
        Store-->>Docs: Snapshot with history boundaries and revision metadata
        deactivate Store
        Docs->>Cache: Refresh snapshot with a bounded expiration
        Cache-->>Docs: Snapshot stored for subsequent readers
    end
    deactivate Cache

    loop For each page of revisions until the client cursor is current
        Docs->>Store: Query revision page, authors, timestamps, and change summaries
        activate Store
        Store-->>Docs: Ordered revision records and next page cursor
        deactivate Store
        opt Attachment previews requested for this page
            Docs->>Media: Resolve safe preview metadata for referenced attachments
            activate Media
            alt Preview is available
                Media-->>Docs: Content type, title, thumbnail, and download reference
            else Preview is not available
                Media-->>Docs: Placeholder and original download reference
            end
            deactivate Media
        end
        Docs-->>Gateway: Append revision page and continuation cursor
    end

    opt Client requests live updates after catching up
        Docs->>Events: Subscribe workspace and document to revision notifications
        activate Events
        Events-->>Docs: Subscription acknowledged with sequence checkpoint
        deactivate Events
    end
    Docs-->>Gateway: History response with snapshot, pages, and live checkpoint
    deactivate Docs
    Gateway-->>Browser: 200 OK with revisions, previews, cursor, and checkpoint
    deactivate Gateway

    Note over Browser,Events: A concurrent edit may arrive after the snapshot but before the client resumes live delivery
    Events-->>Browser: Revision published with sequence and document identifier
    Browser->>Gateway: GET /v1/documents/{documentId}/history?after=checkpoint
    activate Gateway
    Gateway->>Auth: Recheck permissions for the resumed stream
    Auth-->>Gateway: Read grant is still valid
    Gateway->>Docs: Request only revisions after the checkpoint
    activate Docs
    Docs->>Store: Find committed revisions after the checkpoint
    Store-->>Docs: Ordered updates and a new checkpoint
    Docs-->>Gateway: Delta page and new checkpoint
    deactivate Docs
    Gateway-->>Browser: 200 OK with deltas and no duplicate revisions
    deactivate Gateway
    Browser->>Browser: Merge revisions and retain the user's pending offline edits
